  "body_html": "<p>Transform your bedroom into the ultimate sports haven with this custom American football bedding set from Jeminise. Featuring a bold retro design, this comforter or duvet cover is perfect for football players, fans, and coaches who want to bring the spirit of the game into their daily space.</p><h3>Key Features</h3><ul>\n<li>\n<strong>Custom Options:</strong> Features 2 customizable text inputs to personalize with your chosen name and number.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Product Type Options:</strong> Available as either a lightweight duvet cover designed for inserts or a cozy, all-in-one comforter filled with soft microfiber.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Material Details:</strong> Crafted from 100% brushed polyester microfiber fabric for a soft, breathable, and lightweight feel.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Available Sizes:</strong> Comes in standard US Twin (68x88 in / 68x90 in), Full (78x88 in / 79x90 in), Queen (88x88 in / 90x90 in), and King (104x88 in / 104x90 in).</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Easy Care:</strong> Machine washable in cold water, quick-drying, and tumble dry on low heat for easy maintenance.</li>\n<li>\n<strong>Included Components:</strong> Includes 1 duvet cover or comforter, with options to add matching pillowcases or an additional flat sheet.</li>\n</ul><h3>Product Specifications</h3><table><tbody>\n<tr>\n<th>Brand</th>\n<td>Jeminise</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Product Type</th>\n<td>Comforter</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Material</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Fabric Type</th>\n<td>Polyester</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Color</th>\n<td>Retro Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Style</th>\n<td>Contemporary</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Theme</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Pattern</th>\n<td>Football</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Seasons</th>\n<td>All</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<th>Care Instructions</th>\n<td>Machine wash with cold water, Tumble dry on low heat, Iron on low/medium heat</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>",
